      "type": "text",
      "x": 760,
      "y": 770,
      "width": 560,
      "height": 93.75,
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "roundness": null,
      "boundElements": [],
      "text": "Why: Billingo's PUT replaces the whole record and clears\nwhat it leaves out. The read and the write are two requests:\na change made in Billingo in between is overwritten.\nupdate_payment is different: it replaces the whole payment\nlist, so the caller reads the existing payments first.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Why: Billingo's PUT replaces the whole record and clears\nwhat it leaves out. The read and the write are two requests:\na change made in Billingo in between is overwritten.\nupdate_payment is different: it replaces the whole payment\nlist, so the caller reads the existing payments first.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
  ],
